    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112372" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φροντ-ιστήριον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place for meditation,
				thinking-shop,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῶν σοφῶν φ.,</span> of Socrates'
				<i>school,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				94
			</span></i>, al.; <i>monastic community</i> of Indian sages, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				3.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.6
			</span></i>: generally, <i>school, study,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ner.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.41
			</span></i>; <i>lecture-room, auditorium,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procop.Gaz.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				114
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			= Lat. <u>Curia</u> (as if from <i>cura</i>), <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				5.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>law-court,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLips.
				38.14
			</span></i> (iv <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
			</span></i>).</div>
